# Oracle: CC-frontend diagnostics carry exact user-file coordinates.
# The file and line are pinned; the column is not, because the two lowerers
# disagree and the more precise one would fail the other. Line 9 is indented
# four spaces, so the statement starts at column 5: the clean lowerer says 5,
# the reference says 1.
diag_oracle_ccfront_fail.ccs:9:
'!>;' at expression position requires an enclosing '@errhandler' in scope
